    <item>
      <title>Energy-Aware Collaborative Exploration for a UAV–UGV Team</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/saikiran_juttu.github.io/publication/energy-aware-uav-ugv-exploration/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/saikiran_juttu.github.io/publication/energy-aware-uav-ugv-exploration/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This work was submitted to &lt;strong&gt;IEEE/RSJ IROS 2026&lt;/strong&gt;. It proposes a &lt;strong&gt;density-aware layered PRM&lt;/strong&gt; and a &lt;strong&gt;coupled orienteering formulation&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong&gt;energy-bounded UAV–UGV collaborative exploration&lt;/strong&gt; with rendezvous constraints, validated through both simulation benchmarks and real-world experiments.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Graduate Research Assistant</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/saikiran_juttu.github.io/details/grad-research-assistant/</link>
