      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Worked at the Multi-Agent Robotics and Autonomy Lab on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UAV–UGV exploration in Gazebo (ROS2, C++)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incremental PRM planner (C++/Python)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Custom drone hardware for GPS-denied flight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MATLAB vision-based IK solver &amp;amp; motion planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simscape robotic arm with real+sim integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
